---
// Price-alert signup ("watch" in the architecture doc) requires an email
// address and, for CAN-SPAM compliance, a sender postal address that hasn't
// been decided yet (see site README "Open decisions"). Rendered disabled so
// the product page layout matches the eventual form without collecting
// anything we can't send from yet.
---

<section class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 p-4" aria-labelledby="watch-heading">
  <h2 id="watch-heading" class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Get notified on a further price drop</h2>
  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500">Price alerts are coming soon. Check back for this feature.</p>
  <div class="mt-3 flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row">
    <label for="watch-email-disabled" class="sr-only">Email address</label>
    <input
      id="watch-email-disabled"
      type="email"
      placeholder="you@example.com"
      disabled
      aria-disabled="true"
      class="flex-1 rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-slate-100 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-400"
    />
    <button
      type="button"
      disabled
      aria-disabled="true"
      data-testid="watch-signup-disabled"
      class="rounded-md bg-slate-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-500"
    >
      Notify me
    </button>
  </div>
</section>
